  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial1_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 059d02e9c9e0f5e43ad38a843cf4ff3b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 210025852928
    m_Localized: Mr. M, this is mission control speaking, we need a radio check on
      station four. over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1250079027200
    m_Localized: Reading you loud and clear. Stand by for confirmation. Over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1399572410368
    m_Localized: Roger that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1546209472512
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1669429735424
    m_Localized: All clear, connecting you to station 4 now, stand by.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1797947404288
    m_Localized: Copy that, opening two-way communications now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2250307284992
    m_Localized: Why hello there mister! Been a while since we've spoken huh? It's
      time for your routine assessment! Im sure youre more than familiar with all
      this now, but its procedure!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3304126164992
    m_Localized: As you know, Wavebugs help with communications and clean up data.
      And plus, they are very sweet! You'll recognize them with their soft white
      colouring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3465904664576
    m_Localized: 'You can help them along with your amplifying tool (key 2) by boosting
      their signal output! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3631877468160
    m_Localized: "Oh well...\xA6 Maybe next time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3762307739648
    m_Localized: I think you should redo your training courses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3828774875136
    m_Localized: Hello? Are you still there? We cant seem to find your signal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21764969398272
    m_Localized: See? I knew I could count on you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21765808259072
    m_Localized: Nicely done, agent! Here comes another message for you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21766886195200
    m_Localized: Careful though! you got to keep those little guys safe from them
      nasty signavores, they'll try to eat 'em all up, and those breed like rabbits!
      they're a real pain to deal with, so watch out you dont have too many of them
      at one time or else they'll cause too much interference and youll lose the
      signal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24078224523264
    m_Localized: but you're not entirely helpless, give 'em a good tap with your
      Static Reducers (key 1) and that should keep 'em quiet for a while. When your
      run outof actions, end your turn using space. Or before that, thats up to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
